  "description": "AWITOR crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C64 H60 Dy4 N12 O20,2(C1 H4 O1),2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.823-3.927 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 106.46-115.64°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(LH2)4(μ2-OH)4]·2CH3OH·2H2O (C64H60Dy4N12O20·2CH4O·2H2O). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ2-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 μ2-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
